'''Gingerblade''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2018 Christmas Box|Christmas Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2018|2018 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Its blade is made out of gingerbread with white icing placed in a zig zag pattern along the spine. Going down the middle of the blade are small red and green candy pieces. The guard is made up of a large peppermint with icing-covered gingerbread quillons attached to it; the quillon on the left being larger and connected to the handle. The handle is made up of white and green circular candy pieces with a peppermint pommel. 

== Trivia ==
*Its model derives from the limited Roblox back accessory [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/2606191948/Gingerbread-Immortal-Sword Gingerbread Immortal Sword].
*It has a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] counterpart under the name [[Chroma Gingerblade]], which can be found in the same box.
* This and [[Luger]] were used to craft [[Ginger Luger]] during the [[Christmas Event 2018|2018 Christmas Event]].
*It p<nowiki/>artners with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun [[Ginger Luger]], making the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Ginger_Set_(Godly) Ginger Set].
*When salvaged in the crafting station, it provides 20 godly [[shards]].
*There is currently a glitch where if you equip the [[Ghostify]] effect with this knife or its chroma counterpart, the knife will be surrounded by a white translucent rectangle. The rectangle represents the size of the knife’s hitbox.
*This knife used to have a different throwing animation, but Nikilis patched it. 

